    "title": "Dungeon Crawl Pinball",
    "author": "NOVA-16",
    "description": "Descend a dungeon on a torchlit pinball table: take the keys from the side cubbies to open the x3 and x10 slots, clear four levels and beat the Pit Lord in a multiball. The plunger's pull picks your ramp; 1 to 4 players."
